WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.814
Chalky hands. One big tap.

00:00:03.267 --> 00:00:10.790
Small buttons and chalky hands do not mix. So one set fills the screen. Big weight, set count, your cue.

00:00:11.233 --> 00:00:19.081
Change the weight and the bar redraws. You see the plates for each side. Eighty-two kilos, exact.

00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:25.942
When you make the lift, tap Made. The next set loads one step up. Your rest timer starts.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:32.112
If you miss, tap Miss, then call it. You get the causes and the drills that fix it.

00:00:32.567 --> 00:00:36.700
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
